# Cache policy (keep in sync with README 「缓存」)
# - HTML / pages: always revalidate so blog & copy updates show immediately
# - /data/*: short / revalidate — lists & article bodies change often
# - /css/* /js/*: 7 days + revalidate — shell; hard-refresh if you just shipped CSS/JS
# - /img/*: 30 days + revalidate — media rarely changes
# Last matching rule wins. Do NOT put a catch-all /* after the long-cache rules.

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, must-revalidate

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, must-revalidate

/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, must-revalidate
